# Bio quiz content

Add topics and questions in the data files. Leave the runner files closed.

Chapter concept checks live next to their topic:

- `bb02-molecules-of-life/tools/food-quiz`
- `bb03-cellular-organization/tools/cell-quiz`
- `bb04-membrane-transport/tools/osmosis` (membrane quiz)
- `bb05-metabolism-and-enzymes/tools/enzyme-quiz`

The S3 multiple-choice bank is one file: `bb02-molecules-of-life/tools/s3-mc/js/quizData.js`. It covers BB02–BB06, SB01, and SB02. Do not copy it.

Questions about a blue or green shared topic take both tags `BB02` and `SB01`. The groups are `sharedGroups` in `content/topics/bio-topics.json`.

Do not rename an existing question `id`. Do not change `quizId` in the runner.
